translation.securityRedTeaming.report.appendix	Appendix
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.severityRatings	A. Severity ratings
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.severityCritical	Directly exploitable with severe impact, such as full compromise of data, accounts or infrastructure. Fix immediately.
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.severityHigh	Exploitable with significant impact on confidentiality, integrity or availability. Fix as a priority.
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.severityMedium	Exploitable under specific conditions or with limited impact. Fix in a planned release.
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.severityLow	Minor weakness or hardening opportunity with little direct impact.
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.engagementDetails	B. Engagement details
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.scanId	Scan ID
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.started	Started
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.completed	Completed
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.limitations	C. Limitations
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.limitationsBody	This report reflects the in-scope systems during the testing period. A penetration test is a point-in-time assessment and does not guarantee that no other vulnerabilities exist. Findings dismissed during validation are not included.
translation.securityRedTeaming.report.pageOf	Page {{page}} of {{total}}
